      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <p class="intl-eyebrow mb-3">Manuscript format</p>
        <h2 class="intl-h2">Paper template &amp; formatting</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          All manuscripts must follow the official TSAE 2026 paper template (E3S Web of Conferences style). Papers that do not comply may be returned for reformatting.
        </p>
      </div>

